e-means
=======

src/rust/src/emeans.rs is a port of the e-means reference implementation in
faiss, contrib/e_means
(https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss/tree/main/contrib/e_means), by
Gergely Szilvasy, Swann Bessa and Matthijs Douze at Meta FAIR, at upstream
commit f777f7d. The method is described in Bessa et al. (2026), "e-means:
outperforming k-means (in one-tenth the epochs)", arXiv:2611.09501.

